label "Exception handling and recovery diagram"
canvas 460 262
box step 14 100 80 50 "call|fails"
box cls 124 94 116 62 "classify|the fault" acc
box retry 290 20 156 48 "retry, bounded|with backoff"
box fb 290 104 156 44 "fallback|other tool, model, plan"
box deg 290 184 156 44 "degrade honestly|partial result, said so"
arrow step cls
arrow cls retry
arrow cls fb
arrow retry fb
arrow fb deg
arrow retry step dashed via=54,44
text 172 38 "run again" size=10
text 262 76 "transient" size=10 right
text 265 114 "lasting" size=10
text 374 90 "used up" size=10 left
text 374 170 "no path left" size=10 left
note "retry only what can heal — then fall back, then degrade honestly"
